{"seq":19,"slug":"real-analysis-measure","title":"实分析与测度论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 实分析与测度论\n\n牛顿和莱布尼茨发明微积分时，「无穷小」是一个含糊却好用的东西：它有时是零，有时又不是零。一百多年里，数学家凭直觉算对了大量结果，却始终说不清「极限」到底是什么。柯西、魏尔斯特拉斯、戴德金这一代人最终把这件事钉死，用不等式和集合彻底取代了直觉，这套清算工作就是实分析。它不是微积分的复习，而是微积分的地基检查报告：哪些定理为真、在什么条件下为真、反例长什么样。\n\n这个 hub 沿着四条递进的主线展开。第一条是基础：实数为什么必须「完备」，没有这条性质连「单调有界数列收敛」都证不出来；极限如何用 ε-N 语言摆脱直觉；再把这套语言抽象进度量空间，得到开集、闭集与紧致性这些后续一切的工作母机。第二条是连续与微分：把极限作用在函数上得到连续性，区分逐点与一致的细微差别，再用中值定理把局部导数信息撬动成整体结论；函数列的一致收敛则解释了为什么「极限与积分能否交换」是一个真问题。\n\n第三条是积分理论，也是全 hub 的转折点。黎曼积分在严格化之后暴露出致命短板：它对极限运算极不友好，狄利克雷函数这种简单对象就让它失效。勒贝格的革命性想法是「按函数值而非按定义域切分」，为此先要重建长度概念——测度——再在其上定义积分，换来单调收敛、Fatou、控制收敛这三条让极限与积分自由交换的强力定理。第四条是高级与应用：可积函数在 $L^p$ 范数下构成完备的赋范空间，把分析推入泛函分析；傅里叶分析把函数分解成频率，而它的收敛理论恰恰需要勒贝格积分才说得清楚；最后落到 2026 年仍然活跃的前沿，从最优传输到机器学习中的测度论。\n\n读这四章的正确顺序就是它们排列的顺序：完备性支撑极限，极限支撑连续与积分，黎曼的局限催生测度，测度催生现代分析。每一步都不是新发明，而是为前一步补上它欠下的严格性。建议从[实数系与完备性](1_foundations/1_real-number-system-completeness.md)读起，把地基夯实再往上走。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"real-number-system-completeness","title":"实数系与完备性","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/foundations/real-number-system-completeness"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sequences-limits-rigor","title":"序列与极限的严格化（ε-N）","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/foundations/sequences-limits-rigor"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metric-topology-basics","title":"度量与拓扑基础（开闭集与紧致性）","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/foundations/metric-topology-basics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"continuity-differentiation","title":"连续与微分","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/continuity-differentiation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"continuity-uniform-continuity","title":"连续性与一致连续","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/continuity-differentiation/continuity-uniform-continuity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"differentiation-mean-value","title":"微分与中值定理","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/continuity-differentiation/differentiation-mean-value"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sequences-of-functions-uniform-convergence","title":"函数列与一致收敛","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/continuity-differentiation/sequences-of-functions-uniform-convergence"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"integration","title":"积分理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"riemann-integral-rigor","title":"黎曼积分的严格化","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/integration/riemann-integral-rigor"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lebesgue-measure","title":"勒贝格测度","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/integration/lebesgue-measure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lebesgue-integral-convergence","title":"勒贝格积分与收敛定理","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/integration/lebesgue-integral-convergence"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-applications","title":"高级与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/advanced-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lp-spaces-functional-basics","title":"Lp 空间与泛函分析基础","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/advanced-applications/lp-spaces-functional-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fourier-analysis-basics","title":"傅里叶分析基础","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/advanced-applications/fourier-analysis-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications-and-frontiers","title":"实分析的应用与前沿","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/advanced-applications/applications-and-frontiers"}]}]}